meta {
  name: List Course Fees
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/student/payments/finance/course-fees?college_id={{collegeId}}
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:query {
  college_id: {{collegeId}}
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{studentAccessToken}}
}

docs {
  The Course Fees screen: { oneTime[], currentDue[], additional[] } — each
  item is a FeeStructure row with its ledger status
  ("not_started"|"pending"|"paid") and, if paid, the transactionId/paidAt
  of the completed payment.

  - oneTime: rows with yearOrSemester "One-time" (admission fee, university
    registration, etc).
  - currentDue: tuition_fee rows / rows whose yearOrSemester looks like
    "Year N" or "Semester N" — these are the per-semester line items
    (Tuition Fee, Development Fee, Laboratory Fee show up here as separate
    rows sharing the same yearOrSemester).
  - additional: everything else (library, sports, clinical, etc).
}
